description: Save reusable command sequences as runbooks; skip infrastructure for one-offs.
alwaysApply: true
---

## Runbooks

- **Reusable command sequence?** Save as a runbook in `~/.agent-scratchpad/runbooks/{project-name}/`. Skip for one-offs or 1-2 commands.
- **Scripts:** `.sh`, executable, no comments; document all in one `README.md` (`When/What/Usage` per script). Use `.yaml` (`name/description/when/steps`) only if CI or another agent must parse the steps.
- **Check first:** before typing a command sequence, look for an existing runbook and reuse it.
